Analysis: Which columns have little impact on employee retention goals?
Method: Identified columns that do not significantly differentiate
between the best and worst performing employee records.

We recommend considering the removal of these 29 columns:
Age, attrition, businessTravel, department, DistanceFromHome, Education, educationField, EmployeeCount, EmployeeNumber, EnvironmentSatisfaction...

These columns appear to have the least correlation with our performance goals.

